          "line_end": 107,
          "line_start": 102,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "stippi/code-assistant",
          "url": "https://github.com/stippi/code-assistant/blob/ba818a46c472bdd6e9b03fa3a5ca608fdc141e9b/README.md#L102-L107"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_15775f90c04e7347dde6c8a3d8939576c1654f3c1d6a470d906d595703c0a3ec"
      ],
      "text": "The binary offers four interface modes: a native GUI by default, a terminal mode via --tui, an ACP agent via 'acp' for editors like Zed, and a headless MCP server via 'server'."
    },
