        "slc_517c01018a92d88176d3061bb9bd7aa1be106ca165bea2f26652aef470f098db"
      ],
      "text": "The product includes permission tiers and a command sandbox; --sandbox-mode offers danger-full-access (the default), read-only, and workspace-write, with --sandbox-network allowing outbound network access in workspace-write mode."
    },
