        "slc_750b5a99010444cfa1de3c746090dab2bbbb53d0ef08f0e2c5783d54b13e642c"
      ],
      "text": "Browser actions are tagged by capability: navigation, screenshots, and reads are read_only, while submit-style actions with external effect are outward and gated by the existing permission tiers with no new mechanism."
    },
